*WclResFiles: paned_demo.ad
*luiFile: paned_demo.lua
*title: lui WPaned Demo
*foreground: #ecf0f1
*background: #2c3e50
*fontName: Sans-12

*WPaned*grip.width: 10
*WPaned*grip.height: 10
*WPaned*grip.foreground: #e74c3c
*WPaned*grip.borderWidth: 1
*WPaned*grip.borderColor: #ffffff
*WPaned*grip.translations: #override 
 <Btn1Down>: GripAction(start, ThisBorderOnly) 

 <Btn1Motion>: GripAction(move, ThisBorderOnly) 

 <Btn1Up>: GripAction(commit, ThisBorderOnly)
